Package: mrwin
Title: Causal Win Statistics
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Nguyen Thien", "Minh", email = "minhnt@ump.edu.vn", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: R implementation of causal win-statistic methods for hierarchical
    composite endpoints, including the hierarchical comparison kernel,
    adjacent-stratum causal win ratios, dose-standardised GLS pooling,
    multiplier-bootstrap uncertainty propagation, and SDPD MR-Egger diagnostics.
